img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436810/extras/2a569aaee8c399a75f31fd3c334c4ca5.avif?t=1743015367\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>QUITE SOME FEATURES FOR SUCH A SMALL CHICK!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classically inspired single-screen platform action<br></li><li>Hours of fun in solo or two-player couch coop mode<br></li><li>100 challenging levels, each with a unique design<br></li><li>A large variety of different enemies with unique behaviours<br></li><li>Countless secret bonus mechanics<br></li><li>Global Leaderboards &amp; Achievements<br></li><li>Gamepad support with rumble effects<br></li><li>\u2026and an amazing original soundtrack by Zane Little!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436810/extras/fc385d0213cdec29a39353164bbe9dee.avif?t=1743015367\" /></span>",
